    <a class="AnchorLink" id="what-sets-us-apart" name="what-sets-us-apart" data-cms-ai="0"></a>


    
    
    <div class="RichTextModule-items RichTextBody"><div class="HtmlModule">
    
    <a class="AnchorLink" id="html-embed-single-use-350004" name="html-embed-single-use-350004" data-cms-ai="0"></a>


    <style>
    .AsideNavigation {
     	background: none;   
    }
</style>
</div>
<p></p><h2 data-testid="web:rich-text-heading:content-z1l6tn"data-testid-el="title">What sets us apart</h2><p>PitchBook is the ultimate data and research platform for modern investment professionals—including comprehensive market insights and precise data for limited partners. Our platform features a unified, user-friendly interface and seamlessly integrated public and private market data, empowering users to make superior decisions and seize opportunities with unmatched speed and efficiency.</p><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z1l6tm"><b>Research breadth and depth</b></div><p>Navigate challenging conditions with direct access to PitchBook’s elite market analysts, along with detailed data and research across private equity, credit, venture capital, real estate, real assets, infrastructure, fund of funds, secondaries, co-investment, CLOs, and more. No other platform offers this level of depth and expertise.</p><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z1l6tl"><b>Innovation and continuous improvement</b></div><p>Stay ahead with our ever-expanding datasets and cutting-edge technology—including tools backed by advanced machine learning and data science techniques. PitchBook is constantly innovating to keep you at the forefront.</p><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z1l6tk"><b>Market coverage</b></div><p>Find the information you need with detailed company profiles and best-in-class data covering companies, investors, funds, deals, and more.<br></p></div>


</div><bsp-counts-table>
    
