</section><div class="RichTextModule" data-module  data-testid="web:rich-text-module:block-pp0khl">
    
    <a class="AnchorLink" id="rich-text-6a0000" name="rich-text-6a0000" data-cms-ai="0"></a>


    
    
    <div class="RichTextModule-items RichTextBody"><h2 data-testid="web:rich-text-heading:content-z1bcuj"data-testid-el="title">The PitchBook advantage </h2><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z1bcui"><b>Explore best-in-class benchmarking</b></div><p><span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://pitchbook.com/private-market-benchmarks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cms-ai="0"
        >PitchBook’s advanced benchmarking tools</a></span> allow you to create PitchBook benchmarks based on relevant criteria, including deal industry, size, type, geography, and more.</p><p>Our innovative <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://pitchbook.com/solutions/asset-allocation/portfolio-forecasting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cms-ai="0"
        >Portfolio Forecasting tool</a></span> helps you manage your cash flow more efficiently, with the ability to run different scenarios based on PitchBook’s historic cash flow data and proprietary methodology.</p><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z1bcun"><b>Uncover deeper insights into fund strategy and performance</b></div><p>PitchBook provides in-depth coverage of the public, private, and credit markets. Gain a superior understanding of fund performance, with granular data on LPs, GPs, funds—even underlying investments.</p><p>Our proprietary Manager Scoring tool enables LPs to quickly source and evaluate top-performing fund managers. Streamline your allocation decisions with insight into cash flow timing and performance across different strategies and vintage years.</p><p><span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://pitchbook.com/use-cases/asset-allocation" data-cms-ai="0"
        >Learn more about PitchBook for asset allocation »</a></span></p><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-z0rowb"><b>Access the most reliable and accurate data</b></div><p>PitchBook is committed to providing you with the most timely and trustworthy data. Our <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://pitchbook.com/research-process" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cms-ai="0"
        >data collection processes</a></span> are rigorous, and we make regular data enhancements—filling in missing information, correcting errors, and scrubbing existing data with help from <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://pitchbook.com/blog/meet-pitchbooks-data-hygiene-team" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cms-ai="0"
        >our dedicated Data Hygiene team</a></span>.</p></div>


</div><section class="value-propositions" data-module  data-has-background style=" --color-module-background:#f8f5ef;"
 data-module-padding-bottom=small >
    
