                <div class="eyebrow mb-mb-32 pb-blue quote__content-source">G2.com</div>
            
            <figure>
                <blockquote class="mb-mb-32">
                    <h3 class="h3 quote__content-blockquote"><div style="font-size:24px" data-testid="web:rich-text-font-size:block-yyw9mz">“PitchBook is the gold standard for data on privately-backed companies and the VC and PE ecosystem. Over the years they have expanded their coverage to provide excellent data on public companies and M&amp;A as well, and have vastly increased the coverage on international companies. The platform is intuitive and easy-to-use and customer service is top-notch.”</div></h3>
                </blockquote>
                
                    <figcaption class="quote__content-attribution pb-blue text-uppercase">
                       Steven Medley, Senior Market Intelligence Manager, Sidley Austin LLP
                    </figcaption>
                
            </figure>

            
    
