<div class="FaqModule-items"><bsp-faq-question class="FaqQuestion"  data-testid="web:faq-question:block-tnjw2s">
    <div class="FaqQuestion-header" aria-role="button" role="button">
        <div class="FaqQuestion-title" data-testid-el="title">
            <span><p>Why do limited partners choose PitchBook?</p></span>
            <svg class="icon">
                <use xlink:href="#chevron-down"></use>
            </svg>
        </div></div>
    <div class="FaqQuestion-answer RichTextBody" data-testid-el="body"><p>Limited partners use PitchBook’s comprehensive market insights and precise data to evaluate fund performance, conduct due diligence on potential investments, and manage their portfolios, all enhanced by our dedicated account management and continuous platform enhancements.</p></div>
</bsp-faq-question>
<bsp-faq-question class="FaqQuestion"  data-testid="web:faq-question:block-hiendx">
    <div class="FaqQuestion-header" aria-role="button" role="button">
        <div class="FaqQuestion-title" data-testid-el="title">
            <span><p>Why do credit market investors and participants choose PitchBook?</p></span>
            <svg class="icon">
                <use xlink:href="#chevron-down"></use>
            </svg>
        </div></div>
    <div class="FaqQuestion-answer RichTextBody" data-testid-el="body"><p>Credit investors and participants use PitchBook’s best-in-class debt and credit coverage, alongside our robust research and market insights, to evaluate creditworthiness, structure deals, and manage credit portfolios, with the support of our expert analyst access and frequent data updates.</p></div>
</bsp-faq-question>
<bsp-faq-question class="FaqQuestion"  data-testid="web:faq-question:block-8exazp">
    <div class="FaqQuestion-header" aria-role="button" role="button">
        <div class="FaqQuestion-title" data-testid-el="title">
            <span><p>Why do private equity firms choose PitchBook?</p></span>
            <svg class="icon">
                <use xlink:href="#chevron-down"></use>
            </svg>
        </div></div>
    <div class="FaqQuestion-answer RichTextBody" data-testid-el="body"><p>Private Equity firms leverage PitchBook’s detailed company profiles, in-depth market research, and accurate deal data to source investment opportunities, perform due diligence, and track portfolio performance more effectively.</p></div>
</bsp-faq-question>
</div>
        
    

    </div>
</div>
